  card(id: ID!): TrelloCard @rateLimit(cost : 50, currency : TRELLO_CURRENCY) @scopes(product : NO_GRANT_CHECKS, required : [TRELLO_ATLASSIAN_EXTERNAL]) @scopes(product : NO_GRANT_CHECKS, required : [TRELLO_READ_BOARD]) @scopes(product : NO_GRANT_CHECKS, required : [READ_TRELLO_TWG_CLI]) @scopes(product : NO_GRANT_CHECKS, required : [READ_TRELLO_AGENT_INTERFACE])
  """
  Fetches a submitted card batch by ID.
  
