"""
Whether a third-party connection currently holds a live token.

Deliberately binary. Whether the connected tools actually *work* is a separate question answered by
`unsupportedToolIds`, so that a scope-comparison problem can only ever mis-annotate individual tools
and never flip a whole connection's headline state.
"""
enum AgentStudioThirdPartyConnectionStatus {
  """
  A live token exists.
  
  This does NOT mean the tools work: a token can be live and still cover none of the requested
  tools' scopes. Always check `unsupportedToolIds`.
  """
  CONNECTED
  "No live token exists. Offer Connect, subject to `authConsentUrl` being non-null."
  NOT_CONNECTED
}

