"Consumer that a custom skill can explicitly opt into."
enum GraphIntegrationSkillConsumer @renamed(from : "SkillConsumer") {
  ROVO_AGENTS
  ROVO_CLAW
}

"Enum representing the available dimensions of skill metadata that can be queried."
enum GraphIntegrationSkillDimension @renamed(from : "SkillDimension") {
  "Returns installed Forge apps that own one or more discoverable skills."
  FORGE_APPS
  PRODUCTS
}

"""
Consumer surface from which a skill query originates. Used by skill discovery to
honour each skill's `visibility.consumer.optOut` configuration: skills that have
opted out of the requesting surface are excluded from the response.

Entries here MUST correspond by name to entries in the server-side
`io.atlassian.skill.domain.model.Consumer` enum — surfaces that do not have a
matching Consumer entry are treated as a no-op for opt-out filtering (the same
behaviour as the existing component-directory discovery flow).
"""
enum GraphIntegrationSkillSurface @renamed(from : "SkillSurface") {
  ROVO_AGENTS
  ROVO_CLAW
  STUDIO
}

"Which system a skill's tool comes from"
enum GraphIntegrationSkillToolSource @renamed(from : "SkillToolSource") {
  CSM
  FORGE
  INTEGRATIONS_SERVICE
}

"Core metadata used for categorization and versioning."
enum GraphIntegrationSkillToolType @renamed(from : "SkillToolType") {
  CSM_ACTION
  FORGE_TOOL
  PLATFORM_MCP_TOOL
}

"Whether a directory item is enabled or disabled"
enum GraphIntegrationStatus @renamed(from : "Status") {
  DISABLED
  ENABLED
}

"Surface types that can be used to filter actions based on their surface tool action mapping"
enum GraphIntegrationSurface @renamed(from : "Surface") {
  AUTOMATION
  CSM
  POLLINATOR
  ROVO
  ROVO_AGENTS
  ROVO_CLAW
  STUDIO
}

