"""
Canonical product taxonomy for `marketplaceStore.userSites`. Mirrors the
products historically returned by the deprecated `/available-sites` API.

Most values are surfaced as the intersection of two sources:
  - Identity `/v4/permissions/resourcesByPrincipalPermissions` (RBP) grants
  - `MarketplaceStoreTransformer.activeProducts` (TCS-emitted list of products
    currently active on the site, parity with App Switcher's filter)

`CHAT` is a derived value (not RBP-granted, not directly emitted by the
transformer). It is appended whenever the site has a `rovo.ondemand`
entitlement in `activeProducts`; this matches App Switcher's behaviour for
Rovo-1.0 sites and Rovo-2.0 sites that have AI-enabled apps. The corner case
of a Rovo-2.0 site with no AI-enabled apps will over-emit CHAT relative to
App Switcher (cosmetic only; the chat URL handles this gracefully).

Wire-key mapping for both sources is locked in `productEnumMap.ts`. Anything
outside this enum is silently dropped (e.g. `assets`, `rovo`, `devai`,
`atlassian-analytics-free`, Forge-app keys).

Add a value here AND its wire-key mapping in `productEnumMap.ts` to extend.
"""
enum MarketplaceStoreProductType {
  CHAT
  COMPASS
  CONFLUENCE
  GOAL
  JIRA_CUSTOMER_SERVICE
  JIRA_PRODUCT_DISCOVERY
  JIRA_SERVICE_DESK
  JIRA_SOFTWARE
  JIRA_WORK_MANAGEMENT
  LOOM
  OPSGENIE
  STATUSPAGE
  TOWNSQUARE
}

enum MarketplaceStoreRecommendationsSource {
  CONTEXTUALISATION
  GRS
  SEMANTIC_SIMILARITY
}

