"""
Diagnostic flag echoing the resolver mode that served the request:
  STORE — no productFilter supplied; all sites the user has access to are
          returned regardless of which product they entitle.
  EMCEE — non-empty productFilter supplied; only sites containing at least
          one of the requested products are returned (matches the legacy
          `/available-sites?products=…` semantics).
"""
enum MarketplaceStoreUserSitesContext {
  EMCEE
  STORE
