  Optional parameter, for specifying a build tag.
  Overrides the usage of the manifestUrl. The manifest content will be sourced from the build artefact instead
  """
  buildTag: String
  bypassRules: [AppPreDeploymentCheckRules!]
  environmentKey: String!
  """
  Optional parameter, to be used in case a developer wants to patch a specific major version.
