  "Client-generated stable id (a UUID) for this mapping. Returned as `CsmAiAgentToolMapping.id`; reuse the same value on later saves to retain the mapping and its configuration. Distinct ids allow the same `(source, definitionId)` to be selected more than once."
  toolMappingId: ID!
}

"A single configured property input."
input CsmAiAgentToolPropertyConfigurationInput {
  "The allowed values for this property."
  allowedValues: [String!]
  "Id of the property."
  id: String!
}

"DEPRECATED — use `CsmAiAgentToolMappingInput`. Identifies a tool to select on the agent."
