  "Standalone destination mappings to create, update, or delete on this source."
  destinations: [IrisMutateDestinationMappingInput!]
  "Control-plane source node id (`sources[].id` from GET) for `DELETE` or path traversal."
  id: ID
  "Ignored attributes to create or delete on this source."
  ignoredAttributes: [IrisMutateIgnoredAttributeInput!]
  "Operation on this source node (`CREATE` / `DELETE`), or null when used as a path to nested children. `UPDATE` is rejected — source-row fields are not mutable; change identifiers via nested ops."
  operation: IrisMutateOperation
  """
  Deprecated: use `sourceIdentifierAttributes`. Single identifier attribute id on SOURCE CREATE.
  
  
  This field is **deprecated** and will be removed in the future
