"""
The remediation to perform; exactly one of merge or delete (@oneOf). The source
entity lives on the parent JiraRemediationActionInput and is not repeated here.
"""
input JiraRemediationActionDetailInput @oneOf {
  """
  Delete the source entity. Carries no branch-specific fields, so it is sent as
  an empty object: `{ delete: {} }` (not `{ delete: null }` — @oneOf forbids null branches).
  """
  delete: JiraDeleteActionInput
  "Merge the source entity into a target entity."
  merge: JiraMergeActionInput
}

"""
A single remediation action within a batch. The identifying fields (rule,
source entity) are always present and live here; the action detail carries only
what differs per remediation kind.
"""
input JiraRemediationActionInput {
  "The remediation to perform; exactly one branch (@oneOf)."
  action: JiraRemediationActionDetailInput!
  "The id of the rule instance this action pertains to."
  ruleId: ID!
  "ARI of the source entity this action targets. Always required, regardless of kind."
  sourceEntityId: ID!
}

