  backend is used. Keeping it optional preserves existing behaviour.
  RECOMMENDED_APPS_FOR_YOU (`recommended_for_you_exp`) uses gate `enable_recommended_for_you` with
  control value GRS. SIMILAR_APPS (`similar_apps_exp`) uses gate
  `enable_similar_apps_contextualisation` with control value SEMANTIC_SIMILARITY (the legacy
  similar-apps endpoint).
