The live resolver will use `orgId` and/or `cloudId` to resolve an organization
context. When a targeted lookup misses, `returnDefault` will allow callers to
fall back to the user's default organization. `skipCache` is accepted now as a
no-op until caching is introduced.
"""
input MarketplaceStoreUserOrgSitesByRoleInput {
  cloudId: String
  cursor: String
  limit: Int
  orgId: String
  returnDefault: Boolean
  skipCache: Boolean
}

input MarketplaceStoreUserPreferencesInput {
