"""
Optional change to a Focus Area's health value.

Semantics on the containing mutation input:
- Omit the wrapper (or pass null) to leave health unchanged.
- Provide the wrapper with `healthId: <value>` to set health.
- Provide the wrapper with `healthId` omitted or null to clear health.
"""
input MercuryFocusAreaHealthInput {
  "The ID of the health to set on the Focus Area (2001=OFF_TRACK, 2002=AT_RISK, 2003=ON_TRACK). Omit or set to null to clear health."
