"Input for publishing one OS-user SPKI pin for an entitled agent."
input PsmPublishUserKeyInput {
  "Deprecated and ignored: the server sources the acting employee from the authenticated context. Kept optional for backwards compatibility until callers stop sending it."
  atlassianAccountId: ID
