}

"""
Input for psm_raiseTicket. The ticket content is derived server-side (summary/description from the
conversation's opening event, space from the tenant's onboarded JSM space, reporter is the
conversation's account). accountId and deviceId are validated against the conversation and must match.
"""
input PsmRaiseTicketInput {
  "Deprecated and ignored when sourced from context: the server derives the acting employee from the authenticated context. Kept optional for backwards compatibility until callers stop sending it."
  accountId: ID
  "Stable id of the conversation to raise a ticket for."
  conversationId: ID!
  "Device id the conversation is for; must match the conversation's device."
  deviceId: ID!
